    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch05-17: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.52";
    dc:description "Restricted families permit precise algorithmic comparisons, but the universal procedural contrast is not itself well-defined. Public algorithms and theory resolve examples rather than the broad statement.";
